<title>SPAIN: Spain cabinet to review stability plan at meeting.</title>
<headline>Spain cabinet to review stability plan at meeting.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain said on Friday ministers would review the stability plan for 1997 to 2000 at their regular weekly cabinet meeting later today</p>
<p>Local media expect the cabinet to approve the plan, which was made public last weekend and is designed to guarantee Spain a place in the launch of the European single currency.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
